			"notes": "v1.2.0 — Optional API key authentication\n\n- Add an `auth.enabled` config flag to make the API key optional, for setups\n  that delegate authentication to a reverse proxy (HTTP basic auth, OIDC/\n  forward-auth, etc.)\n- When disabled, all endpoints (including admin) are open; the mod logs a\n  startup warning — louder if not bound to a loopback address\n- Toggle it live from the dashboard (Settings → Require API Key); no restart\n- Dashboard: new logo in the sidebar header and as the favicon"
		},
